---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import ProcessIllustration from '../components/ProcessIllustration.astro';
import { SITE } from '../site.config';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="How We Work | Outsourced Accounting Engagement Models"
  description="Choose how you work with us: a dedicated FTE, flexible pay-as-you-go support, or full portfolio management, built around your practice's workload."
>
  <section class="section hero">
    <div class="container hero__inner">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">How we work</p>
        <h1>Three ways to work with us</h1>
        <p class="lead">
          Every practice works differently. Once we understand how you work, we'll help you pick
          one of these models, and you can mix them as your needs change.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="hero__art" aria-hidden="true">
        <ProcessIllustration />
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--alt">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>First, we look at how you work</h2>
      <p class="lead" style="max-width: 720px;">
        Before we take on any work, we look at how you do things now: your workflow, your templates
        and your tools. If what you do already is the most efficient way, we keep it exactly as it is.
        If we think there's a better way, we'll say so and suggest it. The decision to change anything
        is always yours.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>The three ways to work with us</h2>
      <ol class="numbered-steps">
        <li>
          <h3>Dedicated team member (FTE)</h3>
          <div>
            <p>A fixed monthly rate for a dedicated team member (or team) allocated only to your practice, following your hours and your systems. It works like an in-house hire, without the recruitment, screening or training, which we handle on our side. If your allocated person is on leave, we arrange buffer cover so your work doesn't stall.</p>
            <p><strong>Best suited to:</strong> firms with a steady, ongoing volume of work who want consistent, dedicated capacity.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li>
          <h3>Pay as you go</h3>
          <div>
            <p>You only pay for the work you send us, when you send it. There is no minimum commitment and no idle capacity.</p>
            <p><strong>Best suited to:</strong> firms with fluctuating workloads, seasonal peaks or overflow work, or anyone who would like to test the relationship before committing further.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li>
          <h3>Portfolio management</h3>
          <div>
            <p>You hand over full ownership of a client portfolio, including bookkeeping, accounts, tax and everything in between. We manage it end to end under your brand and report back on whatever schedule suits you.</p>
            <p><strong>Best suited to:</strong> firms looking to free up significant capacity by outsourcing whole client relationships, not just individual tasks.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
      </ol>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--alt">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Not sure which one fits?</h2>
      <p class="lead">
        That is what the introductory call is for. We'll talk it through and recommend a starting
        point, and you can change it as we go.
      </p>
      <a class="btn btn--primary" href={SITE.bookingUrl}>Book a Free Consultation</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
